# No tests (forbidden)

Tests are **not allowed** in this project unless the user explicitly asks for tests in the **current** message.

## Forbidden

- Create, edit, rename, or delete anything under `tests/`
- Add or change PHPUnit, Pest, test factories, fixtures, or `*Test.php` files
- Run `phpunit`, `pest`, `sail test`, `artisan test`, or any test filter/command
- Add test scripts, CI test steps, or test-only dependencies
- Propose, plan, or implement tests as part of a task (including “add tests”, “feature test”, “unit test”)

## Instead

- Verify with manual steps or non-test commands (`sail artisan ...`, SQL, browser checks)
- If the only way forward is tests, say so and stop — do not write or run them without explicit user approval in that message

## Exception

Only when the user clearly writes in the current message that they want tests (e.g. “parašyk testą”, “run tests”) — then and only then work on or run `tests/`.
